# step: the package deployed on its own: an mrepo, its service started by its commission
. boot/deploy rt haiccing/base-package-runtime
# expect: Deployed rt as local/rt, from haiccing/base-package-runtime.
# expect: Its service is started.
# step: in the install's mrepos, running
. haicc/mrepos local/rt
# expect: local/rt at rt, from haiccing/base-package-runtime, running.
# step: its validation tests, run in it: its types, its info, its mrepo side
rt runtime/run . packages/haiccing/base-package-runtime/test/validate-in-situ
# expect: Passed: /test/validate-in-situ of haiccing/base-package-runtime, 3 units.
# step: one test alone, its types
rt runtime/run . packages/haiccing/base-package-runtime/test/types
# expect: Passed: /test/types of haiccing/base-package-runtime, 1 unit.
# step: torn down
. boot/teardown rt
# expect: Torn down rt (local/rt)
